results/*
reports/
data/

# The one run every published number and chart derives from is tracked, so the
# figures in the README can be audited and redrawn without an API credential.
!results/v4-adversarial-8b.jsonl
# The same run regraded by a judge that passes its own control, which is what
# makes the judged half of the benchmark readable at all.
!results/v4-adversarial-8b-rejudged-120b.jsonl
# The low-compression control: at 3.5-4.3x nothing is lost, which is what bounds
# the exact-value failure to the high-compression end of the matrix.
!results/v4-budget900-gpt-oss-120b.jsonl
